  "description": "RDLC enforcement for Claude Code — hooks, skills, and wizard setup for research repos. The research-domain sibling of claude-sdlc-wizard.",
  "bin": {
    "rdlc-wizard": "cli/bin/rdlc-wizard.js"
  },
  "files": [
